{{Unobtainable}}
'''Hearscht''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] greatly increases critical chance, speed and health and minimally increases attack range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 185
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hearscht
|name2 = Hearscht CC
|name3 = Revolutionary Hearscht CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hearscht CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Revolutionary Hearscht CC''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hearscht is, for all intents and purposes, completely useless. She has the same critical damage as an equal-level [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Hayabusa]], and her superior critical chance is completely offset by a long attack cycle that only catches one enemy per hit. She only has a niche against longer ranged metals like [[Koronium]] and [[Super Metal Hippoe]], and is outclassed by a wide variety of other superior alternatives anywhere else.

{{Job|Classification = Critter}}

